### Inventory Management 库存管理接口测试

@temuAccessToken = replace-with-temu-access-token

### 更新 Temu 商品 SKU 库存
POST {{baseUrl}}/temu/inventory-management/goods/stock
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}

{
  "site": "US",
  "accessToken": "{{temuAccessToken}}",
  "requestUniqueKey": "stock-update-20260808-001",
  "goodsId": 602238349110173,
  "skuStockTargetList": [
    {
      "skuId": 43510166225830,
      "stockTarget": 100
    }
  ],
  "skuStockChangeList": [
    {
      "skuId": 43510166225830,
      "stockDiff": 100
    }
  ]
}
